  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCING CAPACITY OF HRDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The East and Horn of Africa Human Rights Defenders Project  is geared towards enhancing the capacity of 200 Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) in monitoring, reporting, electronic documentation and data advocacy in North and North-eastern where there is rare access to training opportunities, as well as sexual minorities whose rights are violated as a result of who they are. Deliberate effort will also be made to engage HRDs in the Karamoja sub-region as well as women HRDs.</narrative>
  </description>
